lback main prints a raw Claude-shaped decision, which a Codex-host wire would not honor. The hook's own entry.py:16-18 calls that a silent fail-open.\n4. .claude/hooks/check_cost_envelope.py:187.\n   - The project string is now abspath(CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR) instead of the raw value, and the composite spend key hashes it (_lib/cost_envelope.py:132-139). A CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR with a trailing slash or ./.. segments starts a fresh daily, 7-day and 30-day ledger after upgrade: spend recorded under the old key no longer counts against the cap.\n   - An import failure of _lib.runtime_paths also silently disables the envelope, which the CHANGELOG line (\"without an absolute CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\") does not mention.\n   - Low impact; declare it, or keep the key derivation byte-compatible.\n\ncheck_harness_config.py: no defect found beyond the above.","decision":"GO-WITH-CONDITIONS","sentence":"No declared condition this payload touches is false and I found no P0, but one undeclared P1 should be declared in CHANGELOG [1.4.4] or fixed before GA: when a component fails to import, the canonical-edit fallback blocks every edit, canonical or not, and a guards-only import failure silently disables the gate."},"ttft_ms":5697,"type":"result","duration_ms":488243,"uuid":"3addd753-79a2-428c-aecc-195310436cdd","ttft_stream_ms":4310,"time_to_request_ms":317,"first_content_frame_ms":4310,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":80,"outputTokens":39557,"cacheReadInputTokens":6789633,"cacheCreationInputTokens":232157,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":4.0066426,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":24486,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":232157,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-20T15:54:23.997Z"}
